  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2748,
      "text": "Even if We were to show them mercy and relieve their adversity[34], they would still persist in their transgression, wandering blindly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2749,
      "text": "We have already seized them with punishment, but they did not humble themselves to their Lord, nor did they supplicate in humility,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2750,
      "text": "until when We open for them a gateway of severe punishment, they will be plunged into utter despair.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2751,
      "text": "It is He Who gave you hearing, sight and hearts. How little you give thanks[35]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2752,
      "text": "And it is He Who spread you on earth, and to Him you will all be gathered.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2753,
      "text": "It is He Who gives life and causes death, and to Him belongs the alternation of night and day[36]. Do you not understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2754,
      "text": "But[37] they say the like of what the earlier peoples said.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2755,
      "text": "They say, “Is it that when we die and become dust and bones, will we really be resurrected[38]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2756,
      "text": "This is what we and our forefathers were promised before; this is nothing but ancient fables.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2757,
      "text": "Say, “To whom belong the earth and all those who are on it, if you really know?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2758,
      "text": "They will say, “To Allah.” Say, “Will you not then take heed?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2759,
      "text": "Say, “Who is the Lord of the seven heavens and the Lord of the Mighty Throne?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2760,
      "text": "They will say, “Allah.” Say, “Will you not then fear Him?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2761,
      "text": "Say, “In Whose Hand is the dominion of all things – and He gives protection while none can protect against Him – if you really know?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 347,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2762,
      "text": "They will say, “Allah.” Say, “Then how can you be deluded?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
